 "lines": [
  {"text": "In this town, mirrors don't show your reflection.", "tag": "[mysterious]"},
  {"text": "They show what you'll be doing tomorrow.", "tag": "[intrigued]"},
  {"text": "People use them to prepare for their future.", "tag": "[calm]"},
  {"text": "But there's one rule.", "tag": "[serious]"},
  {"text": "Never look into a broken mirror.", "tag": "[ominous]", "pause": 0.5},
  {"text": "A girl named Ava accidentally dropped her bedroom mirror.", "tag": "[tense]"},
  {"text": "It shattered into hundreds of pieces.", "tag": "[dramatic]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "And in every piece, she saw herself.", "tag": "[uneasy]"},
  {"text": "But each reflection was doing something different.", "tag": "[uneasy]"},
  {"text": "One was crying.", "tag": "[quietly]"},
  {"text": "Another was running.", "tag": "[tense]"},
  {"text": "And one was standing completely still.", "tag": "[slowly]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "Smiling.", "tag": "[whispers]", "pause": 0.5},
  {"text": "Then every reflection suddenly looked directly at her.", "tag": "[fearful]"},
  {"text": "All except one.", "tag": "[quietly]"},
  {"text": "That reflection was pointing behind her.", "tag": "[ominous]", "pause": 0.5},
  {"text": "Ava slowly turned around.", "tag": "[slowly, scared]"},
  {"text": "Nobody was there.", "tag": "[whispers]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "When she looked back, every reflection had disappeared.", "tag": "[fearful]"},
  {"text": "Except the smiling one.", "tag": "[ominous]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "It pressed its hand against the glass.", "tag": "[tense]"},
  {"text": "And whispered,", "tag": "[whispers]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "“Tomorrow is already here.”", "speak": "Tomorrow is already here.", "voice": "reflection", "tag": "[whispers, eerie]", "fx": "whisper", "pause": 0.6},
  {"text": "Then the reflection stepped out.", "tag": "[dramatic, fearful]", "pause": 0.0}
